{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.DominanceWellFounded","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.DominanceWellFounded","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtDominanceCore"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.DominanceWellFounded.domGtOn_induction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.DominanceWellFounded.domGtOn_induction","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/DominanceWellFounded.lean#L96-L102","doc":"Recursion along strict dominance, in the shape an induction on tabloids uses: to prove\n`C a`, it suffices to prove it given `C b` for every `b` that **strictly dominates** `a`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.DominanceWellFounded.instIsWellFoundedDomGtOn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.DominanceWellFounded.instIsWellFoundedDomGtOn","kind":"instance","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/DominanceWellFounded.lean#L93-L94","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.DominanceWellFounded.domGtOn_wellFounded","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.DominanceWellFounded.domGtOn_wellFounded","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/DominanceWellFounded.lean#L87-L91","doc":"**The inner induction of Mathas 3.14 is well-founded.**  Strict dominance is the strict\npart of a partial order, and tabloids of a fixed shape are finite. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.DominanceWellFounded.instIsTransDomGtOn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.DominanceWellFounded.instIsTransDomGtOn","kind":"instance","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/DominanceWellFounded.lean#L81-L85","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.DominanceWellFounded.instIsIrreflDomGtOn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.DominanceWellFounded.instIsIrreflDomGtOn","kind":"instance","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/DominanceWellFounded.lean#L78-L79","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.DominanceWellFounded.domGtOn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.DominanceWellFounded.domGtOn","kind":"def","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/DominanceWellFounded.lean#L74-L76","doc":"**Strict dominance**: `domGtOn a b` says `a` strictly dominates `b`.  Note the\nargument order matches `lexGtOn` — the first argument is the *greater* one. ","signatureChunk":0}]}